# elf.library 2.0's jump table, as GFOpenELF builds it: LVO, call, registers.
# Our own API (README.md, "The API"): OS 4.1's elf.library is an interface,
# not a jump table, so nothing here can match it byte for byte; the DL
# calls follow dlopen's names and meaning, as OS 4.1's DLOpen, DLSym and
# DLClose do.
-30 ElfLoadSeg d1
-36 ElfIdentify a0,d0
-42 DLOpen a0,d0
-48 DLSym a0,a1
-54 DLClose a0
-60 ElfHook d0
-66 ElfLastError a0,d0
-72 ElfErrorString d0
-78 ElfLoadSegDOS d1,d2,a0
-84 ElfAddLoader a0
-90 ElfRemLoader a0
-96 ElfLoadWhy
